  "description": "AWS SDK for .NET V3 is in maintenance mode as of March 1st, 2026, with only critical bugs and security issues addressed until end of support on June 1st, 2026. See https://docs.aws.amazon.com/sdk-for-net/v4/developer-guide/net-dg-v4.html for migration guidance. AWS Elemental MediaPackage now supports Video-on-Demand (VOD) workflows. These new features allow you to easily deliver a vast library of source video Assets stored in your own S3 buckets using a small set of simple to set up Packaging Configurations and Packaging Groups.",
